    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Personal traits",
     "texto": [
      "**kişilik** means «personality». You can describe someone with adjectives: **sakin** (calm), **neşeli** (cheerful) or **dürüst** (honest).",
      "To compare, use **daha** («more»), and to say «the most», use **en**: **Ece benden daha uzun** = Ece is taller than me."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
